Release note for Cyrus SASL XOAUTH2 IdP 1.1.0
=============================================

[2026.4.1]

New configuration
* xoauth2_group_user - specify group users by issuer and scope

Updated feature
* xoauth2_scope - support multiple scopes and wildcards
* xoauth2_aud - support multiple auds
* xoauth2_user_claim - claims can be specified per issuer

